  "citation": "Kimball B A; Mauney J R; Morte R L L; Guinn G; Nakayama F S; Radin J W; Lakatos E A; Michell S T; Parker L L; Peresta G J; III P E N; Savoy B; Harris S M; MacDonald R; Pros H; Martinez J (1992): Carbon Dioxide Enrichment: Data on the Response of Cotton to Varying CO2 Irrigation, and Nitrogen (NDP-037). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/VRC.NDP037",
